{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"1250a2aa233c4f9d27f3e9d945b3ccb1f3f2b8cbe9f7b8f9a1c942431a16b882","slug":"seismology.seismic-wave","location":"/seismology/seismic-wave.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"地震波","content_includes_title":false,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International","CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/blob/main/source/seismology/seismic-wave.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/edit/main/source/seismology/seismic-wave.md","thumbnail":"/seismology101/build/body-wave-propagatio-1e27c198a0a12ffe23f48986050db6a9.jpg","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"seismic-wave.md","url":"/seismology101/build/seismic-wave-06127a6f009e5184cd4af43b31169109.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"page-meta","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✍️ 姚家园、田冬冬","key":"vE7nlMNkfH"}],"key":"vCmF9PkPR6"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📅 2022-11-12","key":"TvkTnEtW6d"}],"key":"cb5EW42m2J"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"⏱️ 20 分钟","key":"XGygUDuHJT"}],"key":"obSFEBf0K1"}],"key":"nP4VBkHT6y"}],"key":"LdgVFDEYwK"},{"type":"thematicBreak","key":"x7T5jXO3hO"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"震源激发的机械振动以地震波的形式在地球内部传播。地震波分为体波（body wave）\n和面波（surface wave）两种类型。体波是指在地球内部传播的波，而面波是指在地球表面\n附近传播的波。本节将介绍最基础的地震波理论。","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"eu7Eh0LXHJ"}],"key":"vpSxy9LhTU"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"DdwJ3ZKQyG"}],"identifier":"id","label":"体波","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"ybGiVxUQRq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波分为 P 波（P-wave）和 S 波（S-wave）两种。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"XWL44NzGwR"}],"key":"ekcFpLGftJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从传播速度的角度看，P 波比 S 波传播速度快。因而 P 波总是最先到达观测者所在的位置，\nS 波则在 P 波后到达。因而，P 波和 S 波也分别被称为 ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"rYsdFl8EnA"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"YTY932VfIb"}],"key":"mWjmQew3er"},{"type":"text","value":"rimary wave 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"PfCFJ1Ih2Y"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"Gp0ldnygdo"}],"key":"MHsVGrbiEq"},{"type":"text","value":"econdary wave。","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"xtG7xIKJeM"}],"key":"EH6DhYqxwd"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从物理属性上来说，P 波是一种纵波（longitudinal wave），P 波在介质中传播时，介质的\n运动方向与波传播的方向相同或相反，介质交替压缩和膨胀导致介质的体积发生变化（如下图所示），\n因而 P 波也称为压缩波（com","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"wYmDFGtxnR"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"aUt0NAWu4K"}],"key":"YnrIDRuMeU"},{"type":"text","value":"ressional wave）。S 波是一种横波（transverse wave），\nS 波在介质中传播时，介质的运动方向与波传播的方向垂直，会造成介质的剪切变形，但\n不改变介质的体积（如下图示），因而 S 波也称为剪切波（","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"WZHDFUBXCH"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"AwPHRzBWFi"}],"key":"mJAsFNuglu"},{"type":"text","value":"hear wave）。","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"XNa5V1Ff6s"}],"key":"Vg5wNEUPri"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"事实上，地震学家首先根据波到达的先后顺序将两种波命名为 primary wave 和 secondary wave，\n并简称为 P-wave 和 S-wave，最后在进一步理解了两种地震波的物理属性后，才分别\n将其称为 com","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"HvL46wlXig"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"uas6EVdosz"}],"key":"wttkZaWVEp"},{"type":"text","value":"ressional wave 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"YYdlPhijse"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"zWriKAQSX5"}],"key":"c3rpbKoy4I"},{"type":"text","value":"hear wave。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"niJ2iEMRDV"}],"key":"UrEvgQJBGu"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/build/body-wave-propagatio-1e27c198a0a12ffe23f48986050db6a9.jpg","alt":"\"体波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向\"","width":"80%","align":"center","key":"NzXSTD7bRW","urlSource":"body-wave-propagation.jpg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向。引自《","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"YAwaESNLVn"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction to Seismology","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"AflziwaGVY"}],"urlSource":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","key":"amX5QhLZke"},{"type":"text","value":"》（第三版）图 3.2。","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"ir7NgsFwGa"}],"key":"Ce8V4YvAeJ"}],"key":"vS1Mxbtwv6"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"jEKSUAa6V5"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"面波","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"QTrahAXxXy"}],"identifier":"id","label":"面波","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"oTe1VZ7ZPR"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"沿着地球表面附近传播的面波也有两种，即瑞利波（Rayleigh wave）和勒夫波（Love wave）。\nRayleigh 波在地表传播时，介质的运动既有与波传播方向相同或相反的分量，又有与波传播方向垂直\n的分量（如下图示）。Love 波在地表传播时，介质的运动方向与波传播方向垂直（如下图示）。\n面波的振幅随着深度增加会剧烈减少。","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"Pegno3qSb3"}],"key":"DBSMEZ644z"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/build/surface-wave-propaga-fbff10c80d09d7d48b1d164c656d27f2.jpg","alt":"\"面波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向\"","width":"50%","align":"center","key":"qB2IckBvGN","urlSource":"surface-wave-propagation.jpg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"基阶 Love 波（上）和 Rayleigh 波（下）的介质运动方向（假设面波沿着页面从左向右传播）。\n引自《","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"Y05anM2W2d"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction to Seismology","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"F9bDp8Am04"}],"urlSource":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","key":"wyZepV6xEq"},{"type":"text","value":"》（第三版）图 8.5。","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"OILAIIsmS4"}],"key":"qlVhPkAtTP"}],"key":"jgM2vE1SyX"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"nIFKQWQ3jv"}],"key":"RLl2G029ON"}],"key":"zEiYrb5s8l"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"震源","url":"/seismology/seismic-source","group":"地震学基础"},"next":{"title":"地震震相","url":"/seismology/seismic-phase","group":"地震学基础"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}